- The PUT_RemoveContract test shows the contract test after the Remove operation is performed on the ArrayList class.
- It uses the generic type from the original ArrayList class and adds any int value.
- Then, it deletes and verifies the deletion process by checking the size of the array, the presence of an item in the collection before and after the delete operation and by checking the deleted item's index and the final index of an item in the ArrayList.
- It does the same checks for each method in the ArrayList class's methods.

